  "title": "Frontier Airlines to Offer Starlink, the Fastest WiFi in the Sky",
  "summary": "DENVER – July 14, 2026 – Frontier Airlines (Nasdaq: ULCC) today announced it will transform the onboard experience by introducing Starlink, the fastest WiFi in the sky. Engineered by SpaceX, Starlink delivers an unparalleled broadband experience in flight, with high-speed, low-latency WiFi capable of HD streaming, online gaming, productivity...",
